  article.main-story__section
    h2 FIP(International Padel Federation) and Premier Padel
    p The FIP is the world governing body that mangages official rankings and the tournament categories of padel.
    p When playing padel internationally there are a couple of padel tours that you can play for official ranking points: the <strong>Premier Padel Tour</strong> (Majors, P1, P2) as the top circuit, plus the <strong>CUPRA FIP TOUR</strong> (Platinum, Gold, Silver, Bronze) as a "step up tour" for rising padel stars.
    p A full season has around 20-24 tournaments worldwide. For each tournament a player/team can earn a certain amount of points to climb the FIP rankings. A table below shows the earned points for winners per category.

